["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Future of AI in the Workplace | Special Episode (Mike Sullivan and Vinay Gidwaney) work genome reducible / irreducible workforce intelligence score amplification score intelligence lock-in PIP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-rationalreminder-ai-时代该由-hr-主导-不是-it-把-ai-当员工雇进来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9befd958d3d16f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代該由 HR 主導，不是 IT：把 AI 當員工僱進來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 當技術採購交給 IT，是把主菜當配菜；真正要拆的是任務而不是崗位，該主導這件事的是 HR，因為 AI 沒有感受，而人需要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"495 陸大鵬談莎士比亞戲劇與英國歷史的互相影響 intertextuality\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-cn2aa250-莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>莎士比亞歷史劇是都鐸王朝的宣傳工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎翁歷史劇歪曲史實極多，本質是都鐸王朝的政治宣傳：醜化理查三世、迴避亨利八世敏感話題，從而鞏固本朝合法性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亞</span><span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"This Is Why People Hate the Government time tax ordeal mechanism improper payment only-once policy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-ezra-时间税-行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>行政羞辱是窮人恨政府的原因：福利申請像一場時間稅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府福利項目中的行政負擔不是效率問題，而是社會控制工具：它用羞辱和文書懲罰窮人，把進步政策變成篩選少數人的漏斗，最終讓受益者恨上政府。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福利制度</span><span class=\"tag\">行政負擔</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Proficiency: From Users to Builders L0/L1/L2/L3 non technical builder Claude skill super user habits index solution archetypes framework\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-practicalai-ai-转型别只盯着-l0-真正值钱的是非技术构建者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bbb70209351aa2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">56:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 轉型別只盯著 L0：真正值錢的是非技術構建者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企業把精力花在把不用 AI 的人拉進來，但真正的槓桿是每個團隊裡那個懂業務、能把隱性知識變成可運行工具的非技術構建者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業 AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">組織轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Back by Popular Demand: How to support your child&#x27;s secure attachment even if you didn&#x27;t grow up with it with Dr. Miriam Steele Strange Situation Adult Attachment Interview reflective functioning good enough mother still face\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-secureattach-童年逆境不必传给孩子-会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>童年逆境不必傳給孩子：會講自己的故事就能打斷代際循環</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">倫敦親子項目發現，父母能否用連貫、靈活的方式講述自己的童年，比童年本身好壞更能預測孩子是否安全依戀——反思功能是可訓練的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">養育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Parallel’s Parag Agrawal: Building a New Web for AI Agents Shapley value grounding fresh index memory hierarchy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-trainingdata-人类点击数据是-bug-agent-搜索重建网络经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca134f7cdc5e5aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>人類點擊數據是 Bug：Agent 搜索要重做索引與定價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當搜索的客戶從人變成 Agent，點擊數據失效，索引、定價與商業模式都要重來；Parag 用質量/成本/延遲三角和 Shapley 給出新框架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 搜索</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Neil Movva - Making AI 10x Cheaper - [Invest Like the Best, EP.488] KV cache HBM SRAM Tensor Core Harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-ilt-推理成本需降3-6个数量级-后台任务才是主战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e8a839c878b0c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>後臺Agent將吃掉90%算力，推理優化該為吞吐犧牲延遲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的下一波不在聊天而在後臺Agent，後者將吃掉90%算力。Sale Research為此優化吞吐而非延遲，甚至接受80%可用性，以換取價格降幾個數量級，並認為Nvidia每瓦優勢被高估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Clayton Page Aldern &amp; The Weight of Nature BMAA DLPFC vmPFC Naegleria fowleri presenteeism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-tpwky-气候变暖不只融化冰川-还在重塑你的大脑决策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>氣候變暖不只融化冰川，還在重塑你的大腦決策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大腦是環境的統計模型，氣候是人為設定的正常值基準。當基準本身在移動，遺忘就成了適應機制——你會在不知不覺中把異常當成常態。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">認知功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"286: ENCORE: Getting into College with Rick Clark holistic review test-optional Common App FAFSA net price calculator\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-asklisa-申请没有万能配方-美国大学录取的反焦虑真相/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">48:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>錄取沒有萬能配方：美國大學申請的反焦慮真相</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低錄取率只是全國約 80 所名校的敘事；對多數家庭，錄取沒有公式，家長最有用的是固定會議和「控制可控項」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美本申請</span><span class=\"tag\">錄取率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Handling Our Kids&#x27; Explosive Anger (with Loryn Brantz) spicy nugget PDA (pathological demand avoidance) Jack in the Box Syndrome radical acceptance\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-unruffled-孩子暴怒时你越插手越糟-他在那个状态里听不见你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>孩子暴怒時你越插手越糟，他在那個狀態裡聽不見你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子的暴怒不是對你的攻擊，是前額葉還沒長好時的失控——他在那個狀態裡聽不見任何道理。大人急著勸、急著講理，處理的其實是自己的不適；有用的是待在旁邊，等他自己走完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Auschwitz: An SS officer’s photo album Solahütte Counterintelligence Corps Frankfurt Auschwitz Trials\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-witness-纳粹屠夫的私人相册-没有惨状只有蓝莓和假期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>納粹軍官相冊裡沒有暴行，只有藍莓和假期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一本 SS 軍官私人相冊記錄的並非暴行，而是度假、聚餐和摘藍莓；它證明屠殺者清楚自己在做什麼，也提醒我們理解大屠殺必須看向施害者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大屠殺</span><span class=\"tag\">納粹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84.49 家央企採買進場，史上最熱WRC：泡沫被擠壓，具身行業進入實戰階段｜14 年從業者的行家鑑別指南 VLA World Model Teleoperation EMG Data Pipeline Post-training\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-lightstar-两万台出货九成吃灰-具身行业进入算roi的实战期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/adbddf5c93cfc63c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>兩萬臺出貨九成吃灰：具身行業進入算ROI的實戰期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WRC的熱浪之下，真正做預訓練的創業公司可能只有一兩家，真實落地需求可能只有出貨量的10%，行業已從秀demo進入算ROI的實戰階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Intel&#x27;s New CPU Finally Makes Sense Fan-out fabric architecture Compute building block Fabric hub UCIe Foveros 3D Direct\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-下一代-xeon-把宝押在-1-2gb-末级缓存上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc7c90dc34e0b3f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 棄用 EMIB 改 UCIe：1.2GB 緩存堆出 256 核</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Diamond Rapids 預計 2027 年發布，最高 256 個 P-core、1.2GB 末級緩存、16 通道 DDR5；用可裁剪的 compute building block 和 UCIe 互連取代 EMIB，大緩存是它對抗 AI 時代的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU 架構</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Michael Kratsios: Trump&#x27;s Science Agenda, Anti-Science Claims, Fauci&#x27;s Damage, DEI &amp; China Eroom&#x27;s Law golden tickets RCP 8.5 GRFP Genesis Mission OSTP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-allin-美国科学不是缺钱-是花钱方式错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/527571f45bcd0e49-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>美國科學不是缺錢，是花錢方式錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NIH 預算從 1998 年 140 億漲到 2024 年 470 億，產出效率卻每 9 年腰斬一次。Kratsios 的答案是：問題不在預算數字，在撥款機制本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技政策</span><span class=\"tag\">科研撥款</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"What Art Does For Your Brain aesthetic distance cognitive reserve hedonic treadmill flow state\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-hiddenbrain-艺术不是消遣-常做艺术的人十年后抑郁风险减半/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">49:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>藝術不是消遣：常做藝術的人十年後抑鬱風險減半</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把藝術當成每日劑量而不是偶爾的消遣：追蹤數萬人的隊列研究顯示，規律參與藝術的人未來十年患抑鬱的風險約為不參與者的二分之一，且這個關係獨立於人口學、行為與遺傳因素。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">認知科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"95% of AI Agent Projects Fail to Reach Production. Here&#x27;s Why | Manoj Saxena, TrustWise runtime governance AI control tower guardian agents semantic action layer trust posture management\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-eyeonai-智能体流量首超人类-ai-失控才是落地最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b277eb062496b5a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>95% 的 AI 智能體項目死在試點：缺的不是智能，是控制層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已從內容生成走向自主行動：95% 的 agent 項目困在 pilot，進不了生產，因為缺的不是智能，而是運行時控制層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Will Photonics Loosen the Bottlenecks in Neural Systems? WDM (Wavelength Division Multiplexing) Semiconductor Optical Amplifier (SOA) McCulloch-Pitts neuron model Indium Phosphide (InP) Femtojoule per operation TDM (Time Division Multiplexing)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-brainsandmachi-光子计算第三次浪潮-五年内走出实验室-先征服无人机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9151fd6dae1293cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brains and Machines</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>光子計算第三次浪潮：五年內走出實驗室，先征服無人機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光子不能像電子那樣相互作用，卻能用波長複用實現超大並行和超低延遲。全光學神經網絡五年內有望落地，第一站不是服務器，而是無人機和實時控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">神經形態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Has the Solid State Transformer’s Time Finally Come? Solid State Transformer (SST) IGBT Silicon Carbide (SiC) Galvanic isolation 800VDC architecture PETT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-asianometry-固态变压器吹了五十年-ai数据中心是第一个真买家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a4d5049243d5f237-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>固態變壓器吹了五十年，AI數據中心是第一個真買家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">固態變壓器在海軍、高鐵、智能電網裡試了三次都沒成，因為它只是「更小」,而AI數據中心的銅線和800伏直流問題第一次給了它必須存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電力電子</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心供電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"317. Plot Twist: The Second Story Hiding Inside Every Great Pitch pitch gatekeeper auteur\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-thinkfast-好提案藏着两个故事-你的故事和对方升职的故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fd7a03d438b4365-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>提案要講兩個故事：一個是項目，一個是對方升職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">好萊塢編劇 Rhett Reese 揭示提案的本質：表面講項目故事，暗線講對方成功的故事。把對方當主角，降低風險、放大回報，提案成功率大增。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提案技巧</span><span class=\"tag\">溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"365 | Vitor Cardoso on Why Black Holes Are Special no-hair theorem Kerr metric light ring cosmic censorship matched filtering last parsec problem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-mindscape-黑洞只有两个参数-形成机制却仍是谜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞只有兩個參數，形成機制卻仍是謎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">引力波與 EHT 確認黑洞確實只有兩個參數，但 120 倍太陽質量的黑洞如何形成、暗物質是否由微型黑洞構成、最後 1 秒差距如何跨越，都是未解之謎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">引力波</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Are We Alone? Cosmic Loneliness and the Longing to Believe (with Adam Kirsch) UAP euphemism treadmill book experience Drake equation AATIP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-econtalk-所有外星人想象都是人类的自画像/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>UFO 熱潮不是天文問題，是信仰問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當證據停留在證詞，宇宙是否擁擠就成了信仰問題。科學越進步，地外生命在觀測裡越稀有；我們談論UFO時，真正在談的其實是自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">UFO</span><span class=\"tag\">外星生命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Medical AI Needs a Referee | Protege&#x27;s Engy Ziedan evals misalignment subnode harness value-based purchasing hedonics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-a16z-医疗-ai-考满分也进不了医院-缺一个独立裁判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">35:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>醫療 AI 考滿分也進不了醫院：缺一個獨立裁判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能答對幾千道醫學題，卻可能在一個真實臨床任務上只有 45% 的正確率。問題不在模型不夠聰明，而在沒人獨立地、持續地測它在真實場景裡到底行不行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">評測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Ben Harris on AI, Fiscal Sustainability, and the Resilience of the U.S. Economy primary deficit crack spread price cap Secure 2.0 Savers Credit\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-macromusings-ai-救不了美国财政-寿命越长-赤字越大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e4617d40206d2eb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">57:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>AI 救不了美國財政：壽命越長，赤字越大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 帶來的樂觀要打對摺——活得久、利率高、資本稅低、軍備競賽，四個機制都在把財政推向更壞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國財政</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 與就業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kidneys for sale repugnant transaction market design non-directed donor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-24-grayarea-禁止卖肾的代价-本不该失去的生命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>禁賣腎的代價：每年 13 萬新症，移植不足 3 萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國每年 13 萬新腎衰病例、移植不足 3 萬，Al Roth 拆解器官買賣的「反感」來源，論證有監管的補償能救命且避免剝削。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腎臟移植</span><span class=\"tag\">器官買賣</span>\n</div></div></a>"]